ould absolutely know  but they might not want to be you know  publicly mentioned so I won't mention  them but all the names you're probably  familiar with and I started saying hey  are you experiencing this as of July 1st  everybody all of these progressive  youtubers are experiencing the exact  same thing now do I believe someone is  deliberately hurting progressive  youtubers by messing with the YouTube  algorithm no I'm not saying that  possible but I have no evidence of that  what I am Telling You is that the effect  of this is that it's endangering  progressive media progressive media is  particularly in danger as a result of  this and as I told you yesterday there's  a three pronged destructive attack of  circumstances on progressive youtubers  right now number one the Trump  administration wants more legal options  against media outlets this includes  libel lawsuits this includes going  legally criminally after media  publishers of information that a leaker  provided to them which would be a  significant change in US policy on that  issue number two we've got the attempt  to rollback Obama era net neutrality  regulations which would also be a  disaster for independent producers like  us and number three you've got the  YouTube advertiser boycott which  continues to be a redistribution of  advertising dollars away from  independent producers like us to  corporate media it's that I mean there's  there's no other way that I can explain  to you that this is absolutely crushing  and whether it's us or some other show  the important thing is if you want to  see these programs survive you should  seriously consider making some financial  contribution as small as it may be it  doesn't have to be our show there's some  other show you like better and if you  look at the youtube comments on our  channel I don't think you'll be  surprised to hear that there are many  people who like other shows better than  this one whatever show you like consider  making a contribution 